WEBVTT

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:05.865
On a phone-sized screen, open your assigned test from the selected route date.

00:00:05.865 --> 00:00:12.312
Confirm the customer, service address, and assembly identifiers before entering readings.

00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:16.549
Field access is limited to assigned operational work.

00:00:30.944 --> 00:00:37.778
Choose the result and record the device readings, performed date and time, and any field notes.

00:00:37.778 --> 00:00:40.778
These are fictional training values.

00:00:40.778 --> 00:00:45.949
Use the actual measurements and required procedure for your device and authority.

00:01:01.195 --> 00:01:04.542
Save a draft while work is in progress.

00:01:04.542 --> 00:01:08.042
Check the saved state before leaving the page.

00:01:08.042 --> 00:01:13.371
Saving a draft does not send the report to the office review queue or approve it.

00:01:31.438 --> 00:01:35.851
When the record is complete, choose Save and submit for review.

00:01:35.851 --> 00:01:40.549
The stored status becomes submitted and office staff can review it.

00:01:40.549 --> 00:01:45.891
This step does not approve the PDF or deliver anything to the municipality.
